# Cursor Rules

This project uses the Universal Agentic Development Protocol.
Primary guidelines and directives are maintained in `AGENTS.md`.

- Read `AGENTS.md` before executing modifications.
- Follow the 5-Phase Agentic Development Loop in `.agentic/WORKFLOW.md`.
- Adhere strictly to rules in `.agentic/rules/`.
- Update project state in `.agentic/Memory/PROJECT_STATE.md`.
